OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Welsh Green Party deputy says
OL,4,AZionism motion 'pointless' after
OL,5,Aquitting party
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Green Party's former deputy leader
OL,8,Fin Wales says he resigned over the
OL,9,Fmotion to declare 'Zionism is racism'
OL,10,Fbecause it was "pointless" and some of
OL,11,Fthe statements made were "disgraceful".
OL,13,FPhil Davies had been a Greens member
OL,14,Ffor seven years, but had announced on
OL,15,Fsocial media on Tuesday his decision to
OL,16,Fquit the party had been "accelerated"
OL,17,Fby the motion over the weekend.
OL,19,FIn the post he had described the motion
OL,20,Fas "imperialistic" and "idiotic", and
OL,21,Fthat it "doesn't materially achieve
OL,22,Fanything in the real world".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
