OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Welsh Green Party deputy says
OL,4,AZionism motion 'pointless' after
OL,5,Aquitting party
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeaking to BBC Radio Wales Breakfast
OL,8,Fon Wednesday, Davies said he "doesn't
OL,9,Fknow why it was discussed as it doesn't
OL,10,Fdo anything to materially improve
OL,11,Fpeople's lives in Palestine".
